journey-map Adding a first site
// From: lib/plausible_web/router.ex:443-500 (/register, /activate, /login), :609-696 (/sites, /sites/new, /:domain/installation, /:domain), lib/plausible/site.ex:13 (onboarding statuses),
// tracker/ARCHITECTURE.md (installation support), lib/plausible_web/router.ex:764-773 (/:domain, settings/goals)
persona Ines blue
  Site owner who wants stats for her blog

[Sign up]
  Register an account score: 4
    description: Fills the live form at /register
  Activate by email score: 3, emotion: Waiting
    description: Enters the code at /activate before she can continue
    pain: Cannot see a site until the email code is entered
[Install]
  Add the site domain score: 4
    description: Creates the site at /sites/new
    thought: One field, that is quick
  Paste the tracker script score: 2, emotion: Unsure
    description: Follows the /:domain/installation page
    pain: Has to add the script to her own site
    opportunity: Installation support verifies the script in a headless browser
  First pageview arrives score: 5, emotion: Relieved
    description: onboarding_status moves from new_site through verification_succeeded and first_pageview to completed
[Explore]
  Read the dashboard score: 5, emotion: Delighted
    description: One page at /:domain with the report panels
  Define a goal score: 4
    description: Adds a conversion goal under /:domain/settings/goals
